---

<section
  id="experience"
  class="w-full max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-margin-desktop relative"
>
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <header
    class="mb-margin-desktop border-[4px] border-on-surface bg-surface-container-lowest p-gutter shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] relative overflow-hidden"
  >
    <!-- Drafting Box Crosshairs (Top Left) -->
    <div
      class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-4 h-4 border-r-[2px] border-b-[2px] border-on-surface"
    >
    </div>
    <!-- Drafting Box Crosshairs (Bottom Right) -->
    <div
      class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-4 h-4 border-l-[2px] border-t-[2px] border-on-surface"
    >
    </div>

    <h1
      class="font-display-xl text-display-xl text-on-surface uppercase mb-4 reveal"
    >
      EXPERIENCE
    </h1>
    <p
      class="font-mono-data text-mono-data text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl bg-secondary-fixed p-2 inline-block border-[2px] border-on-surface"
    >
      LOGGED ENTRIES: CHRONOLOGICAL_DESCENDING_ORDER
    </p>
  </header>

  <!-- Left-Stem Timeline Container -->
  <div class="relative w-full py-4 pl-8 md:pl-16">
    <!-- Left Stem Line -->
    <div
      class="absolute left-[12px] md:left-[24px] top-0 bottom-0 w-[6px] md:w-[8px] bg-on-surface z-0"
    >
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline Item 1: PT Selamat Jaya Persada (Dual Sub-Cards: GAIS SJP & Compro SJP) -->
    <div class="relative mb-12 md:mb-16 group reveal">
      <!-- Node Marker -->
      <div
        class="absolute -left-[26px] md:-left-[47px] top-6 w-5 h-5 md:w-6 md:h-6 bg-primary border-[3px] md:border-[4px] border-on-surface rounded-none -translate-x-1/2 z-20 group-hover:bg-secondary-fixed transition-colors shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]"
      >
      </div>
      <!-- Stem Connector -->
      <div
        class="absolute -left-[20px] md:-left-[40px] top-[30px] md:top-[32px] w-[20px] md:w-[40px] h-[4px] md:h-[6px] bg-on-surface z-10"
      >
      </div>

      <!-- Main Container Card -->
      <div
        class="w-full bg-surface-container-lowest border-[4px] border-on-surface shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] neo-interactive cursor-default"
      >
        <!-- Master Card Header -->
        <div class="border-b-[4px] border-on-surface p-4 md:p-6 bg-primary-fixed">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start flex-wrap gap-2">
            <div>
              <span
                class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase bg-on-surface text-surface-container-lowest px-2 py-0.5 mb-2 inline-block font-bold"
              >
                INTERNSHIP MAGANGHUB
              </span>
              <h3
                class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface uppercase"
              >
                Fullstack Web Developer
              </h3>
              <h4
                class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant font-bold flex items-center gap-2 mt-1"
              >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">domain</span>
                PT Selamat Jaya Persada (Bengkulu)
              </h4>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-1">
              <span
                class="font-label-caps text-label-caps bg-on-surface text-surface-container-lowest px-3 py-1 font-bold"
              >
                21 SEP 2026 - PRESENT
              </span>
              <span
                class="text-xs font-mono-data bg-secondary-fixed text-on-surface px-2 py-0.5 border-[2px] border-on-surface font-bold"
              >
                TOP CONTRIBUTOR (240+ COMMITS)
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Master Card Body: 2 Sub-Cards Side-by-Side (Desktop) -->
        <div class="p-4 md:p-6 bg-surface-container-lowest">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <!-- Sub-Card A: GAIS SJP (Enterprise Asset Management) -->
            <div
              class="border-[3px] border-on-surface bg-surface-container-low p-4 md:p-5 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] flex flex-col justify-between h-full"
            >
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b-[3px] border-on-surface pb-3 mb-4">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span
                      class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-dark font-bold text-xl"
                    >
                      inventory_2
                    </span>
                    <h5 class="font-headline-md text-lg md:text-xl font-bold uppercase text-on-surface">
                      GAIS SJP
                    </h5>
                  </div>
                  <span
                    class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-0.5 font-bold uppercase flex items-center gap-1"
                  >
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xs">lock</span> Internal ERP
                  </span>
                </div>

                <p class="font-body-md text-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-4 font-medium italic">
                  General Affair Information System — Sistem terpadu manajemen siklus hidup dan inventaris aset korporat.
                </p>

                <ul class="space-y-2.5 mb-6">
                  <li class="font-body-md text-sm text-on-surface flex items-start">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2 shrink-0 text-xs mt-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;" data-icon="square">square</span>
                    <span>Mengembangkan sistem internal secara fullstack berbasis <strong>Laravel</strong>, <strong>Inertia.js</strong>, dan <strong>Vue 3</strong>.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="font-body-md text-sm text-on-surface flex items-start">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2 shrink-0 text-xs mt-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;" data-icon="square">square</span>
                    <span>Membangun <strong>DashboardController</strong> dan query agregasi database PostgreSQL untuk kalkulasi status & analitik aset realtime.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="font-body-md text-sm text-on-surface flex items-start">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2 shrink-0 text-xs mt-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;" data-icon="square">square</span>
                    <span>Menulis automated testing (<strong>Laravel Feature Tests / Pest</strong>) pada modul Dashboard, Peminjaman, dan Pemeliharaan.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="font-body-md text-sm text-on-surface flex items-start">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2 shrink-0 text-xs mt-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;" data-icon="square">square</span>
                    <span>Mengoptimasi controller query logic, smart priority sorting, dan sanitasi data pada 9 modul controller.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="font-body-md text-sm text-on-surface flex items-start">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2 shrink-0 text-xs mt-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;" data-icon="square">square</span>
                    <span>Membangun modul scanner kamera QR Code dan cetak label barcode aset yang responsif di desktop & mobile.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="font-body-md text-sm text-on-surface flex items-start">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2 shrink-0 text-xs mt-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;" data-icon="square">square</span>
                    <span>Menjalankan environment development dan database PostgreSQL secara terisolasi menggunakan kontainer <strong>Docker</strong>.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="font-body-md text-sm text-on-surface flex items-start">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2 shrink-0 text-xs mt-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;" data-icon="square">square</span>
                    <span>Memimpin integrasi FE-BE melalui <strong>30+ Pull Request (PR) merged</strong> di repositori tim.</span>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <div>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mb-4 pt-3 border-t-[2px] border-on-surface border-opacity-30">
                  <span class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-primary text-on-primary border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-0.5">Laravel</span>
                  <span class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-primary text-on-primary border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-0.5">Vue.js 3</span>
                  <span class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-primary text-on-primary border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-0.5">Inertia.js</span>
                  <span class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-primary text-on-primary border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-0.5">PostgreSQL</span>
                  <span class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-primary text-on-primary border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-0.5">Docker</span>
                  <span class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-primary text-on-primary border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-0.5">Pest / PHPUnit</span>
                  <span class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-primary text-on-primary border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-0.5">TypeScript</span>
                  <span class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-primary text-on-primary border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-0.5">Tailwind CSS</span>
                  <span class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-primary text-on-primary border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-0.5">DaisyUI</span>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full">
                  <span
                    class="w-full inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2 bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface border-[2px] border-on-surface shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] px-4 py-2 font-bold uppercase text-xs cursor-default select-none"
                  >
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">lock</span> Sistem Internal Perusahaan (Restricted)
                  </span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Sub-Card B: SJP Company Profile (Holding & 8 Subsidiaries) -->
            <div
              class="border-[3px] border-on-surface bg-surface-container-low p-4 md:p-5 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] flex flex-col justify-between h-full"
            >
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b-[3px] border-on-surface pb-3 mb-4">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span
                      class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary font-bold text-xl"
                    >
                      public
                    </span>
                    <h5 class="font-headline-md text-lg md:text-xl font-bold uppercase text-on-surface">
                      SJP Holding Compro
                    </h5>
                  </div>
                  <span
                    class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-secondary-fixed text-on-surface border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-0.5 font-bold uppercase flex items-center gap-1"
                  >
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xs">public</span> Public CMS
                  </span>
                </div>

                <p class="font-body-md text-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-4 font-medium italic">
                  Portal resmi Company Profile holding PT Selamat Jaya Persada beserta 8 entitas anak usahanya.
                </p>

                <ul class="space-y-2.5 mb-6">
                  <li class="font-body-md text-sm text-on-surface flex items-start">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2 shrink-0 text-xs mt-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;" data-icon="square">square</span>
                    <span>Membangun website resmi holding korporat dan 8 lini bisnis anak usaha dalam satu payung identitas digital.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="font-body-md text-sm text-on-surface flex items-start">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2 shrink-0 text-xs mt-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;" data-icon="square">square</span>
                    <span>Mengembangkan <strong>Custom WordPress Child Theme</strong> dengan modularitas komponen dan layout dinamis.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="font-body-md text-sm text-on-surface flex items-start">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2 shrink-0 text-xs mt-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;" data-icon="square">square</span>
                    <span>Mengimplementasikan virtual routing dan integrasi profil portofolio 8 entitas anak perusahaan.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="font-body-md text-sm text-on-surface flex items-start">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2 shrink-0 text-xs mt-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;" data-icon="square">square</span>
                    <span>Menyiapkan arsitektur deployment menggunakan kontainer <strong>Docker</strong> untuk stabilitas dan portabilitas server.</span>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <div>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mb-4 pt-3 border-t-[2px] border-on-surface border-opacity-30">
                  <span class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-secondary text-on-secondary border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-0.5">WordPress</span>
                  <span class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-secondary text-on-secondary border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-0.5">Docker</span>
                  <span class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-secondary text-on-secondary border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-0.5">PHP</span>
                  <span class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-secondary text-on-secondary border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-0.5">Tailwind CSS</span>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full">
                  <a
                    href="https://profile.absenkusjp.com/"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="w-full inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2 bg-secondary text-on-secondary border-[2px] border-on-surface shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] px-4 py-2 font-bold no-underline hover:bg-secondary-fixed hover:text-on-surface transition-colors uppercase text-xs"
                  >
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">open_in_new</span> Kunjungi Live Compro SJP
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline Item 2: SF.CREATIVA (Client / Creative Space Landing Page) -->
    <div
      class="relative mb-12 md:mb-16 group reveal"
      style="transition-delay: 100ms;"
    >
      <!-- Node Marker -->
      <div
        class="absolute -left-[26px] md:-left-[47px] top-6 w-5 h-5 md:w-6 md:h-6 bg-secondary border-[3px] md:border-[4px] border-on-surface rounded-none -translate-x-1/2 z-20 group-hover:bg-primary transition-colors shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]"
      >
      </div>
      <!-- Stem Connector -->
      <div
        class="absolute -left-[20px] md:-left-[40px] top-[30px] md:top-[32px] w-[20px] md:w-[40px] h-[4px] md:h-[6px] bg-on-surface z-10"
      >
      </div>

      <!-- Main Container Card -->
      <div
        class="w-full bg-surface-container-lowest border-[4px] border-on-surface shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] neo-interactive cursor-default"
      >
        <div class="border-b-[4px] border-on-surface p-4 md:p-6 bg-secondary-fixed">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start flex-wrap gap-2">
            <div>
              <span
                class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase bg-on-surface text-surface-container-lowest px-2 py-0.5 mb-2 inline-block font-bold"
              >
                FREELANCE / CLIENT WORK
              </span>
              <h3
                class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface uppercase"
              >
                Frontend Developer & UI Engineer
              </h3>
              <h4
                class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant font-bold flex items-center gap-2 mt-1"
              >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">storefront</span>
                SF.CREATIVA (Creative Space & Cafe)
              </h4>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-1">
              <span
                class="font-label-caps text-label-caps bg-on-surface text-surface-container-lowest px-3 py-1 font-bold"
              >
                NOV 2026
              </span>
              <span
                class="text-xs font-mono-data bg-tertiary text-on-tertiary px-2 py-0.5 border-[2px] border-on-surface font-bold"
              >
                DARK BRUTALISM & PUNK ZINE
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 md:p-6 bg-surface-container-lowest">
          <p class="font-body-md text-sm md:text-base text-on-surface-variant mb-4 italic">
            Landing page modern performa tinggi untuk creative space & cafe SF.CREATIVA dengan estetika dark brutalism, film grain texture, dan tipografi editorial bertenaga.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-6">
            <li class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface flex items-start border-b-[2px] border-on-surface border-opacity-15 pb-2">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2 shrink-0 fill text-sm mt-0.5" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;" data-icon="square">square</span>
              <span>Merancang dan membangun landing page berkinerja tinggi menggunakan <strong>Astro</strong> dan <strong>Tailwind CSS</strong> dengan skor performa dan SEO maksimal.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface flex items-start border-b-[2px] border-on-surface border-opacity-15 pb-2">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2 shrink-0 fill text-sm mt-0.5" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;" data-icon="square">square</span>
              <span>Menerapkan konsep desain <em>Dark Brutalism + Punk Zine Editorial</em>: palet monokromatik kontras tinggi dengan aksen merah menyala, tekstur overlay film grain, serta tipografi Anton & Space Mono.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface flex items-start border-b-[2px] border-on-surface border-opacity-15 pb-2">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2 shrink-0 fill text-sm mt-0.5" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;" data-icon="square">square</span>
              <span>Mengembangkan sistem UI interaktif: filter kategori menu dinamis ("Fuel & Brew"), asymmetric bento gallery ("The Scene"), dan indikator jam operasional toko otomatis real-time (WIB).</span>
            </li>
            <li class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface flex items-start">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2 shrink-0 fill text-sm mt-0.5" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;" data-icon="square">square</span>
              <span>Menciptakan animasi visual halus: filter foto transisi grayscale ke full color saat hover, stiker SVG starburst punk zine, serta infinite marquee text running separator dengan pure CSS.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-4 border-t-[3px] border-on-surface">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-primary text-on-primary border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-1">Astro</span>
              <span class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-primary text-on-primary border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-1">Tailwind CSS</span>
              <span class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-primary text-on-primary border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-1">TypeScript</span>
              <span class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-primary text-on-primary border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-1">Dark Brutalism</span>
              <span class="font-label-caps text-xs bg-primary text-on-primary border-[2px] border-on-surface px-2 py-1">Pure CSS Marquee</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
              <span
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface border-[2px] border-on-surface shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] px-3 py-2 font-bold uppercase text-xs cursor-default select-none"
              >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">lock</span> Private Repo
              </span>
              <a
                href="https://sfcreativa.vercel.app/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#D90429] text-white border-[2px] border-on-surface shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] px-4 py-2 font-bold no-underline hover:bg-[#b00320] transition-colors uppercase text-xs"
              >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">open_in_new</span> Live Demo (SF.CREATIVA)
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline Item 3: Sinta 3 Journal Publication -->
    <div
      class="relative mb-12 md:mb-16 group reveal"
      style="transition-delay: 200ms;"
    >
      <!-- Node Marker -->
      <div
        class="absolute -left-[26px] md:-left-[47px] top-6 w-5 h-5 md:w-6 md:h-6 bg-[#34d399] border-[3px] md:border-[4px] border-on-surface rounded-none -translate-x-1/2 z-20 group-hover:bg-primary transition-colors shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]"
      >
      </div>
      <!-- Stem Connector -->
      <div
        class="absolute -left-[20px] md:-left-[40px] top-[30px] md:top-[32px] w-[20px] md:w-[40px] h-[4px] md:h-[6px] bg-on-surface z-10"
      >
      </div>

      <!-- Main Container Card -->
      <div
        class="w-full bg-surface-container-lowest border-[4px] border-on-surface shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] neo-interactive cursor-default"
      >
        <div class="border-b-[4px] border-on-surface p-4 md:p-6 bg-[#d1fae5]">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start flex-wrap gap-2">
            <div>
              <span
                class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase bg-on-surface text-surface-container-lowest px-2 py-0.5 mb-2 inline-block font-bold"
              >
                RESEARCH / PUBLICATION
              </span>
              <h3
                class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface uppercase"
              >
                Software Engineer & Researcher
              </h3>
              <h4
                class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant font-bold flex items-center gap-2 mt-1"
              >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">menu_book</span>
                Sinta 3 Journal Publication (Jurnal Algoritma ITG)
              </h4>
            </div>
            <span
              class="font-label-caps text-label-caps bg-on-surface text-surface-container-lowest px-3 py-1 font-bold"
            >
              FINAL PROJECT
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 md:p-6 bg-surface-container-lowest">
          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-6">
            <li class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface flex items-start">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2 shrink-0 fill text-sm mt-0.5" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;" data-icon="square">square</span>
              <span>Merancang dan mengembangkan aplikasi web sistem pencarian rute fasilitas rumah sakit berbasis graf menggunakan <strong>Algoritma A* (A-Star)</strong> dan <strong>Valhalla Routing Engine API</strong> untuk kalkulasi jalur tercepat dan penentuan navigasi optimal.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface flex items-start">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2 shrink-0 fill text-sm mt-0.5" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;" data-icon="square">square</span>
              <span>Melakukan visualisasi pemetaan spasial interaktif dengan Leaflet dan OpenStreetMap (OSM) serta mempublikasikan hasil riset ke <strong>Jurnal Terakreditasi Nasional Sinta 3</strong>.</span>
